(5708161, 828999, 40490, '<td valign="top">Creative use of a mirror. Nice framing, and it''s good to see the photographer is in focus. I wonder if it would have looked better if you had gotten the bricks in focus, as well</td>', 'Creative use of a mirror. Nice framing, and it''s good to see the photographer is in focus. I wonder if it would have looked better if you had gotten the bricks in focus, as well', '2009-11-01 07:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
