(5708174, 829154, 40490, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I''m going to say this, but the glare in the other camera''s LCD display is what drops this photos rating for me. It''s a good idea and well executed, though. The colors are very good, as well</td>', 'I can''t believe I''m going to say this, but the glare in the other camera''s LCD display is what drops this photos rating for me. It''s a good idea and well executed, though. The colors are very good, as well', '2009-11-01 07:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5708178, 829089, 40490, '<td valign="top">Clean, crisp, sharp. I like it.</td>', 'Clean, crisp, sharp. I like it.', '2009-11-01 07:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5708181, 830018, 40490, '<td valign="top">This honestly looks like a photo on shooting photos from National Geo (in it''s style), right down to the artistic drop in quality at points. I actually like that about this image. Well executed.</td>', 'This honestly looks like a photo on shooting photos from National Geo (in it''s style), right down to the artistic drop in quality at points. I actually like that about this image. Well executed.', '2009-11-01 07:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5708184, 829989, 40490, '<td valign="top">I wish the two photographers were slightly more in the frame so they seemed like they were in there on purpose and not on accident, but perhaps that''s the whole idea of this contest, is photographers just barely in their scene. After all, isn''t it what they''re producing that''s important?</td>', 'I wish the two photographers were slightly more in the frame so they seemed like they were in there on purpose and not on accident, but perhaps that''s the whole idea of this contest, is photographers just barely in their scene. After all, isn''t it what they''re producing that''s important?', '2009-11-01 07:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
