(5708961, 829783, 83313, '<td valign="top">This isn''t really engaging my interest somehow. Not quite sure what it is. Perhaps the crop does not pull in enough to set the context. Not really sure, however.</td>', 'This isn''t really engaging my interest somehow. Not quite sure what it is. Perhaps the crop does not pull in enough to set the context. Not really sure, however.', '2009-11-01 13:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
