(5713445, 829994, 82707, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> I can''t believe she would climb a ladder wearing flip flops! Didn''t anybody ever teach her about safety? Sure looks like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Judi</a> up there, which would make this a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=82707" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Brat</a> entry. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Flip Flops?? .... you sound like my Mother-Sin-Law! ...there is such a Kiwiness about that phase!!!! .....her <b>thongs</b> were at the bottom of the ladder, and as for safety.....I had her in focus!  ...and....well some of us could hope for a little more ladder action! ...might have helped my score!  :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: I can''t believe she would climb a ladder wearing flip flops! Didn''t anybody ever teach her about safety? Sure looks like  Judi up there, which would make this a  Brat entry.   Flip Flops?? .... you sound like my Mother-Sin-Law! ...there is such a Kiwiness about that phase!!!! .....her thongs were at the bottom of the ladder, and as for safety.....I had her in focus!  ...and....well some of us could hope for a little more ladder action! ...might have helped my score!  :)', '2009-11-04 08:35:29.000000', NULL, 0),
