(5713555, 829886, 40679, '<td valign="top">Lutchenko asked me about the setup, model, etc. I sure would like to tell something!<br/> <br/>Ines is a model I''d never worked with before, but we were planning to for a long while. Finally, for another photo (which I can''t show yet... ;-)) we made a date. We were fooling around a bit and theb I saw this outfit. We made braids in her hair and some pretty basic makeup. <br/> <br/>The setup was also pretty basic as you might see: one softbox at the left side of the camera, one umbrella at the right side of the camera, and a white background.<br/> <br/>PP is easy too: B/W conversion, some curves et voila!<br/> <br/>Thanks everybody for the nice comments and the great votes :D <br/> <br/>Here are some outtakes:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.hannekemeier.nl/div/HMF_ines8.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.hannekemeier.nl/div/HMF_ines8-t.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.hannekemeier.nl/div/HMF_ines8-t.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.hannekemeier.nl/div/HMF_ines8-t.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>:D<br/></td>', 'Lutchenko asked me about the setup, model, etc. I sure would like to tell something! Ines is a model I''d never worked with before, but we were planning to for a long while. Finally, for another photo (which I can''t show yet... ;-)) we made a date. We were fooling around a bit and theb I saw this outfit. We made braids in her hair and some pretty basic makeup.  The setup was also pretty basic as you might see: one softbox at the left side of the camera, one umbrella at the right side of the camera, and a white background. PP is easy too: B/W conversion, some curves et voila! Thanks everybody for the nice comments and the great votes :D  Here are some outtakes:   :D', '2009-11-04 09:38:04.000000', NULL, 0),
