(5715192, 829619, 59029, '<td valign="top">Hi Karma!<br/> <br/>This is an adorable shot.  Love that you shot her from behind rather than pursue the safer route of showing her face.  And she really does seem to be very focused on her shot, glad she''s already learning the value of backlighting!  Would love to see the actual shot if that''s doable. :-)</td>', 'Hi Karma! This is an adorable shot.  Love that you shot her from behind rather than pursue the safer route of showing her face.  And she really does seem to be very focused on her shot, glad she''s already learning the value of backlighting!  Would love to see the actual shot if that''s doable. :-)', '2009-11-05 09:40:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5715196, 829754, 59029, '<td valign="top">Great shot - ''Neither rain nor sleet nor snow will stop the intrepid photographer...'' Love the blue umbrella, really pops and draws you towards the sculpture and the photog, and the glisten of the rain on the ground.  Had no trouble guessing it''s the PNW! :-)</td>', 'Great shot - ''Neither rain nor sleet nor snow will stop the intrepid photographer...'' Love the blue umbrella, really pops and draws you towards the sculpture and the photog, and the glisten of the rain on the ground.  Had no trouble guessing it''s the PNW! :-)', '2009-11-05 09:45:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5715197, 829426, 59029, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot of tourists doing their thing!  Love that you shot from a slightly lower pov, helps emphasize the mountainous terrain of Holland ;-) and helps make the tourists and windmill stand out.  Interesting architecture too, would love to visit some time. :-)</td>', 'Very cute shot of tourists doing their thing!  Love that you shot from a slightly lower pov, helps emphasize the mountainous terrain of Holland ;-) and helps make the tourists and windmill stand out.  Interesting architecture too, would love to visit some time. :-)', '2009-11-05 09:52:11.000000', NULL, 0),
